        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Dog breeds: American Water Spaniel, Estonian Hound\n- Breed ancestry: long-haired ancestor of the American Water Spaniel\n\nFacts:\n- The long-haired breed from which the American Water Spaniel was derived was bred before the Estonian Hound was bred.\n- The American Water Spaniel is a dog breed with a long-haired ancestral breed.\n- The Estonian Hound is a dog breed that was bred after that long-haired ancestor of the American Water Spaniel.",
